# Side-by-side test variant: realistic sniper transaction costs at A$50 per trade.
# Same entry/exit rules as the main sniper; only size and fees differ.
#  - priority fee 0.005 SOL per transaction (what competitive snipers commonly pay;
#    still an ASSUMPTION - it varies a lot with network congestion)
#  - A$500 virtual account so that 10% of cash = A$50 per trade
# Runs as its own paper account (run id sniper-real50) when SNIPER_ENABLED=true.
# Fill-failure and latency assumptions are deliberately unchanged, so the only
# difference from the main sniper is cost and size.
SNIPER_PRIORITY_FEE_LAMPORTS=5000000
SNIPER_STARTING_CASH_AUD=500
SNIPER_MAX_POSITION_AUD=50
